    rw [hsq]
    exact Dvd.dvd.mul_left (dvd_add_one_of_orderOf_eq_two hp (he ▸ h2)) _
  · exact hcls (Or.inl (he ▸ h3))
  · exact hn (CFSG.LieType.SeitzGeneration.normalizesRSubgroup_E6_phi4 q hv hp
